      "en": "<div class=\"question-item official\" data-print-keep><p class=\"question-label\">Exercise 10.2 · Q2.4</p><div class=\"question-prompt\">Write the conjugate base of <span class=\"species\">H<sub>2</sub>O</span>.</div><div data-sheet-slot=\"exercise-2-4\" data-sheet-size=\"medium\" data-sheet-layout=\"block\" data-sheet-label-th=\"แบบฝึกหัด 10.2 · ข้อ 2.4\" data-sheet-label-en=\"Exercise 10.2 · Q2.4\" style=\"--sheet-print-height:20mm\"><div data-sheet-answer><span class=\"species\">OH<sup>−</sup></span> forms when <span class=\"species\">H<sub>2</sub>O</span> loses one H⁺. The charge changes from 0 to −1.</div></div></div>"
    },
    "exercise-3-1": {
      "th": "<div class=\"question-item official\" data-print-keep><p class=\"question-label\">แบบฝึกหัด 10.2 · ข้อ 3.1</p><div class=\"question-prompt\">เขียนคู่กรดของ <span class=\"species\">SO<sub>3</sub><sup>2−</sup></span></div><div data-sheet-slot=\"exercise-3-1\" data-sheet-size=\"medium\" data-sheet-layout=\"block\" data-sheet-label-th=\"แบบฝึกหัด 10.2 · ข้อ 3.1\" data-sheet-label-en=\"Exercise 10.2 · Q3.1\" style=\"--sheet-print-height:20mm\"><div data-sheet-answer><span class=\"species\">HSO<sub>3</sub><sup>−</sup></span> ได้จาก <span class=\"species\">SO<sub>3</sub><sup>2−</sup></span> รับ H⁺ หนึ่งตัว ค่าประจุเปลี่ยนจาก −2 เป็น −1</div></div></div>",
      "en": "<div class=\"question-item official\" data-print-keep><p class=\"question-label\">Exercise 10.2 · Q3.1</p><div class=\"question-prompt\">Write the conjugate acid of <span class=\"species\">SO<sub>3</sub><sup>2−</sup></span>.</div><div data-sheet-slot=\"exercise-3-1\" data-sheet-size=\"medium\" data-sheet-layout=\"block\" data-sheet-label-th=\"แบบฝึกหัด 10.2 · ข้อ 3.1\" data-sheet-label-en=\"Exercise 10.2 · Q3.1\" style=\"--sheet-print-height:20mm\"><div data-sheet-answer><span class=\"species\">HSO<sub>3</sub><sup>−</sup></span> forms when <span class=\"species\">SO<sub>3</sub><sup>2−</sup></span> gains one H⁺. The charge changes from −2 to −1.</div></div></div>"
